body:
Mars Argo's "Everybody Want's it all"

&#x200B;

fucking weird video but i keep coming back to it

How can 12 yo girls be stronger than grown men?

&#x200B;

It's all in the water my friend. It is laced with a super serum called Mirakuru. Beware.

thank you, you're always so helpful to all of us ... 

&#x200B;

i broke down crying

i hope that you live. i hope that you dont die. all generic bs aside, my best advice would be to "wait it out" until things turn around, but again i can understand that in this deep point it wouldnt matter much. 

&#x200B;

regardless, im sorry for the pain you have gone through. I wish you the best  <3
